# Carried in from Booty Bay: 1117 Rumors for Kravel, 1137 News for Fizzle and 1183 Goblin Sponsorship (Shimmering Flats),
# 2872 Stoley's Debt (Steamwheedle Port), 1953 Return to the Marsh (Tabetha), 1261 Marg Speaks (Brackenwall).
# 1436 Alliance Relations is not carried: segment 13 hands it in to Keldran in Orgrimmar.
# Carried out: 2874 and 648 (Booty Bay), 864 (Undercity), 1262 (Orgrimmar), 3520 (Feralas screechers, back to Yeh'kinya).
# Order: Booty Bay -> Undercity (Zinge errands) -> Thunder Bluff (Deadmire) -> Gadgetzan (bind) -> Shimmering Flats -> Dustwallow Marsh ->
# Flats/Gadgetzan booster run -> Wastewander camps -> Thunder Bluff (train 44) -> western and central Tanaris -> OOX escort -> Steamwheedle Port and Lost Rigger Cove -> Gadgetzan.
# The Field Sampling power source (654, two-hour timer) is only used after the level 44 grind.
# Skipped on purpose: 1118 Back to Booty Bay chain (two extra Booty Bay round trips), 1954 The Infernal Orb (orb is in Desolace),
# the elite 1166/1172/1173 and Zul'Farrak 2864.

# ---------- Booty Bay -> Undercity -> Thunder Bluff -> Gadgetzan ----------
N Teleport: Undercity instead of taking the boat (no Teleport yet? Fly to Grom'gol and take the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades) | You start in Booty Bay. This segment uses three Teleports, so carry 4-5 Runes of Teleportation.
TRAIN | Undercity Magic Quarter: learn your level 42 spells if you did not train at the end of the last segment
A 232 | Apothecary Zinge in the Apothecarium
T 232 | Alessandro Luca
A 238 | Alessandro Luca
T 238 | Back to Apothecary Zinge
A 243 @ Undercity, 50.1, 68.0 | Apothecary Zinge. You hand this in at Gadgetzan.
N Still no mount? @ Tirisfal Glades, 60.0, 52.6 | Only if you can afford it now: ride up the road to Brill. Velma Warnam teaches riding and Zachariah Post sells the horses, both just west of the inn. Cast the next Teleport from there. Otherwise skip this step.
N Teleport: Thunder Bluff (or take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and fly to Thunder Bluff if you don't have it)
A 1205 | Melor Stonehoof on Hunter's Rise. Deadmire is in Dustwallow Marsh; you bring the tooth back here when you come to train at 44.
FLY Gadgetzan | Tal, the wind rider master in Thunder Bluff
S Gadgetzan | Innkeeper Fizzgrimble at the inn
T 243 | Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle, in the middle of town
A 379 | Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle. Keep it for the Wastewander camps later.

# ---------- Shimmering Flats ----------
T 1117 | Ride north out of Gadgetzan into Thousand Needles and on to the Mirage Raceway. Kravel Koalbeard is on the gnome side of the track. He then offers Back to Booty Bay: skip it.
T 1137 | Fizzle Brassbolts, also on the gnome side
T 1183 | Pozzik, on the goblin side of the track
A 1186 | Pozzik
T 1186 | Razzeric, right next to Pozzik
A 1187 | Razzeric. The booster is in a crashed zeppelin in Dustwallow Marsh.
A 1190 | Pozzik
N Ask Zamek for his distraction @ Thousand Needles, 79.8, 77.0 | Zamek stands on the goblin side. Take Zamek's Distraction from him; while his explosion goes off, run straight to Rizzle's tent on the gnome side.
T 1190 | Click Rizzle's Unguarded Plans in the tent while Rizzle is away
A 1194 | From the same plans
T 1194 | Pozzik

# ---------- Dustwallow Marsh ----------
FLY Brackenwall Village | Ride back south to Gadgetzan and fly from there
A 1168 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 37.4, 31.4 | Tharg
A 1169 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 37.1, 33.1 | Draz'Zilb. Skip Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern (elite).
T 1953 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 46.1, 57.1 | Ride south down the road to Tabetha's hut. She then offers The Infernal Orb: skip it, the orb drops in Desolace.
C 1205 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 48.8, 56.8 | Deadmire is a level 45 crocolisk in the water just east of Tabetha's hut. Frost Nova him and kite with Frostbolt.
C 1187 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 54.1, 56.5 | The crashed zeppelin is a short way further east. Loot the Gizmorium Shipping Crate inside the wreck.
C 1261 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 55.8, 63.0 | Marg's Jeweled Pendant: ride south-east from the wreck to the shore. Muckshell Clackers, Pincers and Scrabblers (39-43) walk the beach around 54-57, 61-65. Each has about a 5% chance to drop the pendant, so expect roughly 20 kills.
C 1168,1169 | Ride west along the south of the marsh into the Wyrmbog. Firemane Scouts and Ash Tails are in the north-west part (around 42, 67); Firemane Scalebanes and the Searing Hatchlings and Whelps are further south-east (around 47, 74). The tongues and hearts drop from the hatchlings and whelps. Stay away from the big Onyxia's Lair cave entrance.
T 1261 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 35.2, 30.7 | Back in Brackenwall: Nazeer Bloodpike
A 1262 | Nazeer Bloodpike. Keep it for Orgrimmar (next segment).
T 1168 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 37.4, 31.4 | Tharg
T 1169 @ Dustwallow Marsh, 37.1, 33.1 | Draz'Zilb
A 1170 | Draz'Zilb
T 1170 | Overlord Mok'Morokk
A 1171 | Overlord Mok'Morokk
T 1171 | Draz'Zilb. Skip the next part, The Brood of Onyxia (elite).

# ---------- Shimmering Flats again ----------
H Gadgetzan
T 1187 | Ride north to the Mirage Raceway: Razzeric
A 1188 | Razzeric
T 1188 | Ride back to Gadgetzan: Shreev at the Gizmorium
